# Local AI planning docs / blueprints — never commit (see session rule).
docs/superpowers/

# Coding-agent scratch space. Listed here, not only in a personal global gitignore,
# because the tooling reads *this* file: biome resolves ignores through
# `vcs.useIgnoreFile`, and vitest's `./**` test globs need the same exclusion (see
# `AGENT_SCRATCH` in vitest.config.ts). `.claude/worktrees/<branch>/` holds a full
# second checkout, so without this a nested biome.json breaks `npm run lint` and a
# second copy of every spec joins the suite.
.claude/
.superpowers/
